<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- SECTION 1: EXECUTIVE SUMMARY -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<div class="page-break"></div>

<p class="section-tag">Section 1</p>
<h2>Executive Summary</h2>

<p>Culture Media is an Alberta-based digital marketing agency that owns and operates a network of media platforms reaching 290,000+ engaged Albertans. We are submitting this proposal in response to the Alberta Equestrian Federation's Marketing &amp; Creative Services RFP, with a single objective: grow total AEF membership by 3% over the next four months.</p>

<p>Our approach combines targeted digital advertising, organic content amplification, email marketing, and community-driven outreach across four distinct audience pathways: barn owners and facilities, the broader recreational equestrian community, families and new riders, and lapsed members. Each pathway is designed to convert a specific segment of Alberta's equestrian population into AEF members.</p>

<p>What sets this proposal apart is our owned media advantage. When AEF partners with Culture Media, your campaign gets immediate organic amplification across our Instagram accounts (40,000+ followers), website (60,000+ monthly page views), and newsletter (5,500+ subscribers) at no additional cost. This built-in reach reduces the paid media spend AEF would otherwise need and accelerates time-to-results from day one.</p>

<div class="callout">
<p style="margin: 0;"><span style="color: #003356; font-weight: bold;">Campaign at a Glance:</span> A 4-month digital campaign delivering strategy, creative production, social media execution, paid ad management, landing page development, email sequences, and bi-weekly performance reporting for a total investment of $9,500. Paid media spend is separate and determined by AEF (recommended: $1,500 to $3,000). Our platform amplification provides an estimated $3,000 to $5,000+ in additional organic exposure at no charge.</p>
</div>


<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- SECTION 2: COMPANY OVERVIEW -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<div class="page-break"></div>

<p class="section-tag">Section 2</p>
<h2>Company Overview</h2>

<p>Culture Media is an Alberta-based digital marketing agency that owns the media platforms reaching this province every day. When AEF partners with us, your campaign gets amplified across our entire network at no additional cost.</p>

