<td>Targeted campaigns across Meta (Instagram &amp; Facebook) and Google Search reaching equestrians in both rural and urban Alberta. Includes setup, management, A/B testing, and ongoing optimization.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Landing Page &amp; Email</td>
<td>Conversion-optimized campaign landing page, email sequences for new leads, and re-engagement flows for lapsed members.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Tracking &amp; Reporting</td>
<td>Bi-weekly performance reports covering reach, clicks, conversions, new memberships, and cost-per-acquisition. Full campaign wrap-up report at project close.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>


