<h3>Paid Media Spend</h3>

<p>Paid media budget is separate from the campaign services fee above and is determined by AEF. We recommend $1,500 to $3,000 for the 4-month campaign. Our platform amplification significantly reduces the paid spend that would otherwise be required to reach the same audience size.</p>

<h3>Bonus: Organic Platform Amplification (Included Free)</h3>

<p>AEF campaign content will receive organic exposure across our entire 290,000+ person network, including Instagram, website, and newsletter placements. Estimated value of this amplification: $3,000 to $5,000+. This is included at no charge as part of the partnership.</p>

<h3>Hourly Rate &amp; Additional Costs</h3>

<p>Any work falling outside the scope defined in this proposal will be billed at $75 per hour. All out-of-scope work requires written approval from AEF before any hours are committed. There are no hidden fees or surprise charges.</p>

