<!-- SECTION 13: WHY CULTURE MEDIA -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<div class="page-break"></div>

<p class="section-tag">Section 13</p>
<h2>Why Culture Media</h2>

<p>There are several reasons AEF should choose Culture Media as its marketing partner for this campaign.</p>

<h3>Alberta Experts</h3>
<p>We do not just market in Alberta. We are Alberta. Our platforms, audience, and content are rooted here. We understand rural communities, equestrian culture, and how Albertans actually engage online. This is not theoretical knowledge from a national agency. It is lived experience from a team that creates content about Alberta every single day.</p>

<h3>Built-In Audience</h3>
<p>290,000+ Albertans already follow our platforms. AEF gets immediate visibility without building from scratch. That means faster results and a lower cost-per-acquisition compared to starting from zero with paid media alone.</p>

<h3>Hands-On Execution</h3>
<p>We do not hand you a strategy deck and disappear. We build the assets, run the campaigns, manage the ads, and optimize weekly. AEF gets a team that is actively working on this campaign every week, not a consultant who checks in once a month.</p>

<h3>Maximum Value</h3>
<p>Your $9,500 delivers $12,000 to $15,000+ in total value when you factor in our organic platform amplification. No other agency in Alberta can offer this combination of owned reach, hands-on execution, and transparent pricing at this budget level.</p>


